[neutral]
Quack
Quack keeps track of moderation cases. Rules managers define the rules on the dashboard, moderators apply them, and Quack carries out the rule's action.
Moderators: /case add, /case view, /case list, /case history, /case void, /appeals
Rules: /rules (rules are edited on the dashboard)
Setup: /setup (needs Manage Server)
Use /help with a topic for more.
<Open the dashboard>
